WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.510
NARRATOR: From Yosemite's
iconic green valley,

00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:07.900
to its secret eastern edge.

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:11.620
The little rain reaches
this arid landscape.

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:15.759
Blocked by over 13,000 feet
of solid Sierra Nevada.

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:22.660
An alien desert-like habitat.

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:25.210
Home to one of the
park's strangest females.

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:28.765
A praying mantis.

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:35.790
It's the last days of
summer in Yosemite,

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:39.990
and she's coming to the end
of her seasonal feeding spree.

00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:44.640
Her main weapons,
prominent front legs lined

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:46.470
with shark tooth-shaped spikes.

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:53.040
The praying mantis is the
only insect on the planet

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:54.540
with three-dimensional vision.

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:09.440
Her lightning fast strike
clocks at 1/20 of a second.

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:12.470
But this is only a cricket
drumstick appetizer.

00:01:16.190 --> 00:01:18.980
She releases a concoction
of alluring pheromones

00:01:18.980 --> 00:01:21.035
into the air.

00:01:21.035 --> 00:01:21.935
Oh do mantis.

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:26.975
One lucky guy picks
up the signal.

00:01:40.150 --> 00:01:43.135
Maybe some eye contact can
smooth out this first date.

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:49.530
Or maybe not.

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:55.400
In exchange for his
would-be wooing,

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:57.320
the Casanova is attacked.

00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:04.860
It's impossible for
him to free himself.

00:02:10.789 --> 00:02:12.770
The male's head is ripped off.

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:18.720
The female's final main course.

00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:24.560
It's an abrupt end
to a first date.

00:02:28.780 --> 00:02:29.680
Or is it?

00:02:34.190 --> 00:02:36.770
The decapitated male
is still moving.

00:02:50.830 --> 00:02:53.770
The headless torso of
the male praying mantis

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:56.785
is still controlled by
nerves in the abdomen.

00:02:59.940 --> 00:03:03.120
In a final mating act,
his body completes

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:04.170
what his head started.

00:03:07.470 --> 00:03:10.515
The female, on the other hand,
is busy finishing dinner.

00:03:14.070 --> 00:03:18.180
She'll mate with multiple
males each breeding season.

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:21.990
Not all of them will
suffer the same fate.

00:03:21.990 --> 00:03:24.210
But the males who
are decapitated

00:03:24.210 --> 00:03:27.600
may father the most eggs.

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:34.260
The ultimate sacrifice in a
unique Yosemite love story.

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:35.160
[BIRDS CHIRPING]

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:38.810
[MUSIC PLAYING]

